1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,980
Once upon a time, there was a man who died.

2
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,940
The story the man wrote was about a happy prince

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:12,560
who loved everyone and was loved by everyone.

4
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:17,620
The people fought, each wanting him to love them and them alone.

5
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:23,000
And an evil raven pecked at the loving hearts of one person after another.

6
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,720
The more the prince loved them and tried to save them,

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,700
the more the people's love just fed the raven,

8
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,920
In the end, the raven thought,

9
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,960
I'd like to try eating the prince's heart,

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,700
the most delicious one of all.

11
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,520
Thank you.

12
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,520
Hey.

13
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,520
Alright, just what's going on?

14
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,520
And who is she?

15
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,520
Why did the story just...

16
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:43,520
I will make sure it doesn't double back again.

17
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:46,520
Fakir, what are you trying to accomplish?

18
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,520
Wait a minute.

19
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:50,520
You're not thinking of rewriting the story that's controlling this town, are you?

20
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:54,520
All I want is the power to protect people. That's it.

21
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:57,520
Altor, can I ask you something?

22
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,520
What's that?

23
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:02,520
My power, is it really something that makes stories into reality?

24
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:06,520
You're sure I'm not writing things that will become reality anyway?

25
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,520
The two are part of the same power.

26
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:12,520
Listen to me, if your power is immature, then of course it's going to be swayed by reality.

27
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:18,520
But if you develop a strong power, reality should start bending towards and obeying your stories.

28
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:23,520
It would then be a trivial matter to move on to manipulating the fates of all mankind.

29
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:40,520
The power to protect, eh?

30
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:44,520
Did I actually write down a story that saved her with my own power?

31
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:49,520
Or was I made to write it?

32
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:54,520
Her feelings for Mewto are spilling up through my hand and out onto the page.

33
00:03:54,520 --> 00:04:02,520
Even though I couldn't write one letter of a story about Mewto, I could write a story to save hers if it were flowing from me.

34
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:07,520
But the story I need to write is about Mewto.

35
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:17,520
I meant Fakir's?

36
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:25,520
That manuscript… He said he wrote that for me.

37
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:30,520
Oh, Uzzurra!

38
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,520
I guess you got back safe too, huh?

39
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,520
Fakir!

40
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,520
So you're awake. You're hungry, right?

41
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,520
Yeah.

42
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:45,520
Well, that's the story you wrote.

43
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,520
It's a story that's over now.

44
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,520
The story about me that Fakir wrote for me.

45
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,520
I kind of wanted to read it.

46
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:58,520
But I'm really glad you're able to write stories now, Fakir.

47
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:05,520
And then when I told him that I thought the five gates had heart shards in them, he said congratulations.

48
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:09,520
So basically, those shards are the only ones sealing away the raven.

49
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:11,520
Now we can go and get them all!

50
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:15,520
We could. It would also restore the raven.

51
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,520
Calm down, will you?

52
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:24,520
It's a bridge we'll have to cross eventually, and if we don't get moving, Mewto might not be able to return to normal.

53
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,520
Yeah, that's true.

54
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:32,520
I guess even if the raven is restored, it'll be no problem now that you've got the power of stories, right?

55
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,520
You do your best.

56
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:40,520
That's right. Mewto has Fakir and he has Princess Tutu.

57
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,520
He'll never lose to the raven.

58
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,520
And I'm sure Roo will return to normal too.

59
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,520
Roo?

60
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,520
Roo?

61
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,520
Roo?

62
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,520
Good morning, Prince.

63
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,520
Prince, huh?

64
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,520
Hmm.

65
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,520
Prince, you're hungry, aren't you?

66
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,520
I'm hungry.

67
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,520
I'm hungry.

68
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,520
I need to meet me.

69
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,520
I need to meet me.

70
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,520
Hello, Crane.

71
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,520
Yes, I am hungry.

72
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,520
Stop!

73
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:35,520
Now what did you do that for? You love me, don't you?

74
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:39,520
You don't love me?

75
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:43,520
My love has done nothing but make you into this.

76
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:46,520
I have no right to love you.

77
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,520
Is that... Mewto?

78
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,520
Let's dance.

79
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,520
My Prince.

80
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,520
Of course.

81
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,520
Oh, Prince.

82
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,520
I don't think I've ever seen Roo dance so, so sadly.

83
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:07,520
Do you remember all the pas de deux we danced together?

84
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,520
You're my Prince.

85
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:14,520
That's right.

86
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:17,520
Yep. After all, that's what Father said.

87
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:21,520
The Prince who sealed me away deserves our hatred.

88
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:28,520
But, he is the one Prince that you should marry, Crane.

89
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:35,520
A Prince who loves everyone should be able to sincerely love even an ugly, pitiful girl like you.

90
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,520
You really think?

91
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,520
Yes, I really do.

92
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:44,520
The only time I was happy was the time that I spent with you.

93
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,520
Mewto! Mewto!

94
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,520
Mewto!

95
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,520
I wanted you to look at me alone.

96
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:53,520
I wanted never to be without you. Not even for a moment.

97
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,520
Hey, look! Is this pretty?

98
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,520
Yes.

99
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,520
I have to get back to Fakir soon. He'll be getting worried.

100
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,520
What? Wait, watch me!

101
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,520
I'm sorry.

102
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,520
No! Stay and watch me, please!

103
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,520
I practiced as hard as I could!

104
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,520
But you... you didn't.

105
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:16,520
Crane, go to the human world as a human girl and win the Princess love.

106
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,520
Yes, Father.

107
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:24,520
And if you should ever get hold of a shard of the Prince's heart, I need you to bring it to me at once.

108
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:29,520
Because I have a task to perform in preparation for your wedding to him.

109
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,520
I will.

110
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:46,520
Today is the first day of lessons for those in the Beginner's class. So I'll take this time to talk about ballet and marriage. Ballet and marriage are inextricably intertwined!

111
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,520
Hello, Rue.

112
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:51,520
We can see each other every day now, my Prince.

113
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,520
Muto!

114
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:56,520
Call Muto Prince again and I'll make sure you regret it.

115
00:08:57,520 --> 00:09:00,520
Then I won't do it as long as you agree not to get in our way.

116
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:06,520
I didn't want anyone to know I was a crow, so I sealed away the memories.

117
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:09,520
My beloved daughter.

118
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:13,520
I honestly was convinced that I was father's daughter!

119
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:22,520
I'm a fool. There's no way a mere human like me could marry the Prince from the story.

120
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:26,520
So, all this time, Rue really wasn't Kreyi at all.

121
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:29,520
Shall we dance, Kreyi?

122
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:48,520
Rue?

123
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,520
Duck?

124
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,520
Why does Muto look like that?

125
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,520
You saw?

126
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,520
That's right. It was my fault.

127
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,520
Go ahead, laugh at the foolish girl tricked by a raven.

128
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,520
I wouldn't laugh at you.

129
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:04,520
Liar! I know you're thinking this serves me right.

130
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,520
No, I'm not.

131
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:08,520
Leave me be.

132
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:13,520
Rue, inside the five town gates are the heart shards that are sealing away the raven.

133
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:17,520
If we return them, I know Muto will go back to normal.

134
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,520
They're sealing the raven away?

135
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,520
No, you mustn't!

136
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:26,520
Should the raven be restored and the Prince get his heart in its entirety,

137
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,520
he'll give his heart over to the raven.

138
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,520
What?

139
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,520
But if the Prince goes back to normal…

140
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,520
What if he doesn't go back to normal? What then?

141
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,520
But I…

142
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,520
The raven was using us to make the Prince give him his heart.

143
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:42,520
That's all he wanted!

144
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:43,520
No way, but then…

145
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:46,520
Listen to me, don't do anything else!

146
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,520
Rue, I…

147
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,520
I'm begging you, please stop!

148
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,520
If it were me, if I were Princess Tutu,

149
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:58,520
I'd never give him his heart back.

150
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,520
Now what? What should I do?

151
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:07,520
What a shame for you, little duck!

152
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:09,520
The story won't end that easily, you know!

153
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,520
First, that's not really tragic enough!

154
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,520
Now what?

155
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,520
Quack!

156
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,520
Quack!

157
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,520
Quack!

158
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,520
What's wrong with duck, Sora?

159
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,520
Duck doesn't know.

160
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,520
Huh?

161
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,520
That's the myself who's a puppet, Sora!

162
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,520
There's a thing she doesn't know.

163
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,520
A thing she doesn't know?

164
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,520
A thing she doesn't know?

165
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,520
A thing she doesn't know?

166
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,520
A thing, Sora?

167
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:36,520
A truth that should have been revealed after the Prince's heart was stolen by the raven.

168
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:38,520
The prince from the prince and the raven has become real!

169
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,520
I see.

170
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:42,520
And the raven has become real as well, and is being restored as we speak!

171
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,520
This town really is being controlled by stories!

172
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:45,520
My hypothesis was right on the mark!

173
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:48,520
I'm a knight who was given the fate of death in vain.

174
00:11:48,520 --> 00:12:08,520
My sword would prove useless in protecting the prince.

175
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,520
So you want to write?

176
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,520
Yes.

177
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:17,520
Well to be frank, you have no hope of rewriting Drosselmayr's stories at your level of power.

178
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:20,520
If you're only where the story is writing itself through you,

179
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:23,520
then there's no way you can make your stories reality.

180
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:25,520
I'm aware of that.

181
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:28,520
That's why I'm asking you for your help, Autor.

182
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:30,520
And just why should I have to do that for you?

183
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,520
Listen, I need your knowledge.

184
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:35,520
And all I'm saying is, why should I?

185
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,520
What?

186
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,520
Mewto.

187
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:42,520
What does Mewto want me to do?

188
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,520
What?

189
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,520
Uzzurath?

190
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:48,520
You're going to stop being duck, aren't you, Zora?

191
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,520
What?

192
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:53,520
My self told me so, Zora.

193
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,520
My smell?

194
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:03,520
My self is here inside me, Zora.

195
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:09,520
The sound of Uzzurath's heart.

196
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:13,520
This music is...

197
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,520
Miss Ada!

198
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,520
It's been a while, hasn't it, duck?

199
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,520
Miss Ada!

200
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:24,520
There's a thing the duck doesn't know.

201
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,520
What?

202
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,520
The duck's... pendant.

203
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,520
My pendant?

204
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,520
Yes.

205
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:33,520
That's the last of the prince's heart shards.

206
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:39,520
It resonates with the heart shards because it is a heart shard itself.

207
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:43,520
That shard is what awakens Princess Tutu.

208
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:49,520
Princess Tutu, the only one who can give the prince's heart back to him.

209
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,520
I get it.

210
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:54,520
Before the prince shattered his heart, it was his will that he'd someday get it back.

211
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:55,520
Isn't that right?

212
00:13:56,520 --> 00:14:02,520
However, whether or not the duck returns that heart shard to the prince depends on her own will.

213
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,520
Miss Ada!

214
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:07,520
My will is the same as Mewtwo's.

215
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,520
Qua...

216
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:12,520
You look like you feel better, Zora.

217
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,520
Qua...

218
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:16,520
Qua...

219
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:39,520
The Pendant, you're giving it to the Prince Sora, and then you'll go back to being a Duck Sora, and then we won't be able to talk to each other anymore, Zora.

220
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:50,520
And even if I put water on you, you won't change back, Zora?

221
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:54,520
Yeah, that's right. That me's the real me.

222
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,520
You're really a Duck, Zora?

223
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:59,520
Now don't cry, okay?

224
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,520
Okay, Zora.

225
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:09,520
Zora, no, that cursed Edel had to butt in. That was the secret I was saving for my last bit of fun.

226
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:14,520
Well, no matter with things as they are, they won't be able to escape the tragedy.

227
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:18,520
Ohh!

228
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:24,520
Aaaaahhh!

229
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:26,520
Ahh!

230
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,520
Ah memang, ehm...

231
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:33,520
Biri steal!

232
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:43,520
Ne of Toph!

233
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:47,520
Won't you dance with me?

234
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:51,520
Why are you so, so frightened of me?

235
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:55,520
He's right.

236
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:59,520
Just now I was afraid of Mewtwo.

237
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,520
Whoa, dearie!

238
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:17,520
The prince!

239
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,520
Can you dance with me?

240
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,520
When I'm not dancing with someone,

241
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:37,520
I'm uneasy and lonely.

242
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:41,520
And it hurts so much I can't stand it.

243
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,520
My prince...

244
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,520
I'm sorry, my prince.

245
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:49,520
You're suffering because of the raven's blood.

246
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:53,520
The hearts of these birds hurt people.

247
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:57,520
Even the people you love.

248
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,520
The more love you have for them,

249
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:03,520
the more pain you cause them.

250
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:05,520
With my own hands,

251
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,520
I've thrown into chaos

252
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,520
this heart of yours that loves everyone.

253
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:11,520
Every part of this has been my fault,

254
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:15,520
just because I wanted to have your love all to myself.

255
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,520
I'm so sorry!

256
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:19,520
Rue!

257
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:21,520
Tutu!

258
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:23,520
This pendant that transforms me into Princess Tutu

259
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,520
is also a shard from the prince's heart.

260
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:27,520
So it is the will of the prince himself

261
